Subject: [PATCH] drivers: jtag: fix resource_size.cocci warnings
In-Reply-To: <1501679918-20486-3-git-send-email-oleksandrs@mellanox.com>
References: <201708032250.cmVljGeY%fengguang.wu@intel.com>
